<h1 id="sample-vault" data-sourcepos="9:1-9:14">Sample Vault</h1>
<p data-sourcepos="11:1-11:205">An invented library for Lectern's tests — nothing here is real. It moves from plans → notes → archive, cites § 4 of a made-up spec, and marks progress with ✅ done, 🔒 locked and ⚠ check first.</p>
<p data-sourcepos="13:1-13:71">The project lives at <a data-sourcepos="13:22-13:53" href="https://example.com/lectern/docs">https://example.com/lectern/docs</a> and nowhere else.</p>
<p data-sourcepos="15:1-15:71"><del data-sourcepos="15:1-15:31">The first plan was dropped.</del> The current one is under <code data-sourcepos="15:58-15:70">work/alpha/</code>.</p>
<p data-sourcepos="17:1-17:92">Personal notes: <a data-sourcepos="17:17-17:46" href="notes/r%C3%A9sum%C3%A9%20notes.md">r</a>, also reachable as <code data-sourcepos="17:67-17:91">notes/résumé notes.md</code>.</p>
